1. Install go fiber = go get -u github.com/gofiber/fiber/v3
2. Install pgx do driver for db = go get github.com/jackc/pgx/v5
3. Install grpc by running these command

 - go get google.golang.org/grpc   ---> grpc installation
 - go get google.golang.org/protobuf --> protobuf installation 
 - go install google.golang.org/protobuf/cmd/protoc-gen-go@latest
 - go install google.golang.org/grpc/cmd/protoc-gen-go-grpc@latest


 protoc --go_out=. --go_opt=paths=source_relative --go-grpc_out=. --go-grpc_opt=paths=source_relative proto/catalog.proto
 